    "result_text": "The full suite is green (2/2 tests pass, `BUILD SUCCESS`), and `AcceptanceTest` is the only test class in the project.\n\n## Summary\n\nI implemented the `contactPreference` field on the owner resource, following the repository's established pattern for derived read-only fields (like `membershipLevel` and `locality`):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a `contactPreference` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema. The DTO (`OwnerDto`) is generated from this spec, so this creates the field on the response.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 Added a derived getter `getContactPreference()` returning `\"EMAIL\"` when an email is present (non-null, non-blank), otherwise `\"PHONE\"`. MapStruct auto-maps this getter onto the generated DTO by name, exactly as it does for `getMembershipLevel()`.\n\nNo mapper or controller changes were needed \u2014 MapStruct's existing `toOwnerDto` mapping picks up the new getter automatically. Both acceptance tests (`corePhoneWhenNoEmail`, `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) pass.",
